<title>UK: QUALITY - Lufthansa UK Q4 cargo report.</title>
<headline>QUALITY - Lufthansa UK Q4 cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo AG a unit of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, issued its latest monthly report on service standards for Lufthansa Cargo and its handled carriers.</p>
<p>It said these now reflects by Lufthansa Cargo, Cathay Pacific, Croatia Airlines, South Africa Airways, Tarom and Thai Airways.</p>
<p>The report gives results for the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
